{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "792ba77dfe53fc5b00742c57e852bba142760f4fb1733311aa55f52c8038efeb", "ja": "桃子が先輩なんだから！", "zh": "桃子可是前辈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a9bbcf19d1d99c15a918e632b5d463df166e6b35c8971de5b0b1233d12cb47c5", "ja": "リコッタのレッスンが始まる。他のメンバー\nに厳しくダメ出しをする桃子。しかしそれ\nは、桃子がリコッタのことを大切に思うから\nこそだった。桃子は春香に任命され、\nレッスンの指導係となる。", "zh": "『Ricotta』的训练课程开始了。\n桃子严格地指正其他成员，\n但那是因为桃子很重视『Ricotta』。\n于是桃子被春香任命为训练课程的小老师。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "885ae281f5182bd60e5601df4577f0dd0c9b203c2810bcc0460a548b00595b6d", "ja": "（今日は、リコッタのメンバーそろっての初レッスン。\nもちろん、俺も立ち会うことになっているが……）", "zh": "（今天是『Ricotta』第一次全员到齐的训练课程。\n当然我也在旁边陪同……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "20b104f4c479092154a52d8987d22c5784ba40a92fe3382530abaef2ed4df69c", "ja": "よし。それじゃ、そろそろ始めようか！\n……って、あれ？　亜利沙は？", "zh": "好，那我们差不多可以开始了！\n……咦？亚利沙呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "c1b431428b13c4c0d582118ec67539fcf70d9cc517fd8e5184baa3266043e10a", "ja": "まだ来てないみたい。\nお兄ちゃん、どういうこと？", "zh": "她好像还没有来。\n大哥哥，怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "25c56b53a042cc0cd59905c226b27873ea47077534399314cdbe41fd749f883e", "ja": "おかしいな、集合時間は伝えたんだが……。", "zh": "奇怪了，我应该有告诉她集合时间才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "e65e6704c16254c2beadaef401c7c127fa420f554e2694b38ab7ea87cacc6829", "ja": "うわぁ～んっ！　遅刻遅刻ぅっ！", "zh": "呜哇～！要迟到了、要迟到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "f6833ab5feb982dc4e87d35a31c5f09869e40d3d3f7b0589b44698fcb588f964", "ja": "はぁ、はぁっ……あ、ありさ、全力で走りましたから、\n時間にはギリギリ間に合いましたっ！　ピースっ♪", "zh": "呼哈……呼哈……还、还好亚利沙拚了命狂奔，\n勉强赶上了！Peace♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "00cd6c74d1833d56801ba73fcdd5ce8f3c2a2662c69e1991c99309bfd86561d5", "ja": "ピース、じゃないよ、亜利沙さん。\n全然間に合ってないし。", "zh": "该说的不是Peace吧，亚利沙姊。\n你完全就是迟到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "825a423a94817e993d24e2db208966def1caa5385ef0d4ccbce8c0e2575eba41", "ja": "レッスンの5分前には着替え終わって、\n待機してるのがジョーシキでしょ？", "zh": "课程开始的五分钟前要换好衣服待命，\n这不是常识吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "5c778655b32ba5792ae80a66202a18a23216486575a98c4d4b60d3a9f7db9829", "ja": "ううっ！　か、返す言葉もないです……。\nごめんなさいっ、桃子ちゃん！", "zh": "呜呜！亚、亚利沙无话可说……\n对不起，桃子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "0aa6f33a431527640cb80690fa251e627970c5c3d97cff600f5cd7df6ad4bb8f", "ja": "謝るなら桃子にじゃなくて、みんなにだよ。\n春香さんだって、予定を合わせてくれてるんだから。", "zh": "要道歉不该对桃子说，要对大家说才对。\n人家春香姊也是特别排出时间来参加的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "18bcd72a399b44314e662cc5d49a4375ca6f4edcda10ea86f1c38459b9002d56", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、桃子ちゃん、亜利沙ちゃん。\n私も今日のお仕事は、このレッスンだけだから。", "zh": "没关系啦，桃子、亚利沙。\n我今天的工作就只有来参加训练课程而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "398a439c4359895c669753c37d20fb270bdea4b09676dc0ed686661f2a8243b6", "ja": "は、春香さん……女神様みたいな優しさです……！\nありがたや、ありがたや……！", "zh": "春、春香……简直像女神一样温柔……！\n感恩女神，赞叹女神……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "1c9daa65f33e287b876ee0ece339ef8eb46f387362ff88652cd919a9bb956505", "ja": "で、でも。春香さんは忙しいのに……！", "zh": "不、不过，春香姊是在百忙之中……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f56113bb1444b14ea4b4a73679763426f056915e5608ad15c6b5c45016547c7d", "ja": "まあまあ桃子。亜利沙も、次から気を付けような。\n拝んでないで、とりあえず着替えてこようか。", "zh": "算了啦，桃子，亚利沙下次应该就会注意了。\n亚利沙也不要再膜拜了，赶快去换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "ce1dabd85779c17bb620db0186a2109f8389c5c5b1491b09d949d9f53d7860e2", "ja": "は、はいっ！　ありさ、次は気をつけます～！\nそれじゃ、着替えてきますっ！", "zh": "好、好的！亚利沙下次会注意的～！\n那亚利沙去换衣服了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "a93b600502b6e6e040b6c4c1f0b86007423920ea5eb832e7a62830436d7e3273", "ja": "……もう！　お兄ちゃんは、甘いんだから。\n甘やかされて困るのは、亜利沙さんなんだからね。", "zh": "……真是的，大哥哥你太好讲话了啦！\n你太宠亚利沙姊的话，最后苦的还是她自己喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "b402956c05d36677910b5f12d35cefd19777085a6123127d483cbecc2f61b4de", "ja": "春香さん、奈緒さん、のり子さん。桃子達は、\n先に準備始めてよう。お兄ちゃんは、音楽の用意！", "zh": "春香姊、奈绪姊、法子姊，桃子我们先开始准备吧。\n大哥哥，请你去放音乐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5479d86423815ef572cdbccaae19fa0659f466697a45459a25548c4c3e6dd60e", "ja": "わ、わかった！", "zh": "我、我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "29f6d8728e5a323df3bca2ddd8d4c1eb4ffacf236667143d92f7119235b43a74", "ja": "ふふっ。桃子ちゃん、頼もしいなぁ～♪", "zh": "呵呵，桃子真可靠～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "6e70e6be48236d85de459b18fcb038ce49cd287847b7129a1a0d34b0e1ad0a2a", "ja": "それじゃみんな、軽く体ほぐしとこっか！", "zh": "那大家稍微来热身一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "dc56ee5ebc0000f62d1fef8565af3bc1a35b1c1ba7d92e610ffda14437f32478", "ja": "せやな！　{$P$}さん、\n音楽待ってますね～♪", "zh": "嘿呀！{$P$}先生，\n等你下音乐啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "a9c7bdf3e19c983cf7e8934f51f2aafc05bd5f50d604058769148559a0b32e8b", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー。\nワン、ツー、スリー、フォー……。", "zh": "1、2、3、4，\n1、2、3、4……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "f1c39e5bc5e44374b6cf5a3a3537ab29aeb13ddceff2c5365e93f84c45839df2", "ja": "ワン、ツー……あ、あれっ？\nアカン、また間違えてしもたー！", "zh": "1、2……咦，奇怪？\n吼唷，我又弄错啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "4cd0cd892f23fcd2dcbd029fc61ff9f47d4cc446541d843df2c034e3a05091a6", "ja": "もう、奈緒さん。そこ間違うの、3回目だよ？\nできないとこだけ反復練習して、ちゃんと覚えて！", "zh": "真是的，奈绪姊，那个地方你已经弄错第三次了耶。\n请你反复练习不会的地方，认真把舞步记起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "fd3b46e06c8b60c9c3f96239af1206dd5568d252f8a46b3070b48c8e1d5a973c", "ja": "わ、わかりました～！", "zh": "我、我知道了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "178a4d807da5cd42e9fd0e7feab3f158208d836c33331cad60342ed85ad42edd", "ja": "あははっ、しっかりしなよ、奈緒！", "zh": "哈哈哈，要认真一点喔，奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "33eb3380b2df164674efe0330664010e004f8238192cca2eb8c827fe326491e1", "ja": "のり子さんも。そこの振り、間違ってるよ？\nちゃんと鏡を見て、メンバーと合わせて。", "zh": "法子姊也是，这边的动作错了喔。\n仔细看镜子，动作要跟其他成员一致。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "0f07aaf0b0ddd0fdbd6dc1c8d64a17290802d83a1bf82500070eaafc426b2591", "ja": "ええっ、ホントに！？\nうわ、全然気づいてなかったよ……ありがと、桃子！", "zh": "咦咦，真的吗！？\n哇，我完全没注意到……谢谢你，桃子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "dbc50ef088fb8663144e4945a083d3f2d1866c501b2159e66ec53c8d7e2564ba", "ja": "桃子、すごいじゃないか。\nみんなのこと、よく見てるんだな？", "zh": "桃子，你好厉害喔。\n你都有在仔细观察大家耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "313524ac33d8a2c526844b67557b542e939e870aacea2b9a3d49f23e6daf8f84", "ja": "ふふん、当然だよ。\n桃子はみんなより、業界では先輩だからね！", "zh": "哼哼，这是当然的。\n桃子可是比大家都早进入演艺圈的前辈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "7b91927b6528d638ec54dfd88c8c3690dc04ee8836f050ae30bf3185eff68bdb", "ja": "春香さんは……もしかして、あんまり体力ない？\n曲の後半、バテちゃってるよね。", "zh": "春香姊……你是不是其实体力不好？\n你到曲子后半段就没力了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "60edd354f64c0cf44bdd3174c3d5b137cf6b5d55387d9e29633528c8e8ec76e8", "ja": "わっ、気付かれちゃった！？\n桃子ちゃん、本当にすごいかも……！", "zh": "哇，你注意到了吗！？\n桃子，你真的好厉害喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1032_001har", "source_sha256": "a597e1873d5285f37e9bb6e363e8c225d3b3df3c7407bd6d91782fb85a54dd7e", "ja": "そうなの、今の課題なんだ。\nもっと体力つけないとーって！", "zh": "没错，这就是我目前的课题。\n必须再加强体力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "6a81039af0b96abc0058cc9db56e52fc857b8b617cf602bba42532feff313afb", "ja": "亜利沙さんは……。", "zh": "亚利沙姊则是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "1cb5d34559028f81fdfce66624af2e31a3097938c745d4beefc5fd8bb2d8ae18", "ja": "は、はいぃっ！？", "zh": "怎、怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "5844352bae3db651ba69be7e740b66b63d82061dbd1cdd393f337d7ccc598533", "ja": "ダンスも歌もヘロヘロで、見てられないよ！\nもっと気合い入れて！", "zh": "舞蹈跟歌声都软趴趴的，令人看不下去！\n你要再多加把劲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "4f641595a2ae5503a525c3d0845109c00098e9f976c76873b5eed79751d8dfd9", "ja": "ううっ……が、頑張ります～っ！", "zh": "唔唔……亚、亚利沙会加油的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "34f0d1f24e9ccd8becae680722f2ac9d00fef27e9b8d17fc6282123cb812a8a7", "ja": "まったくもう……そんなんじゃライブ、\n乗り切れないよ？　はい、もう一度最初からね！", "zh": "真是的……这样可撑不过演唱会喔。\n好，再从头来一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "21cb82b3122a830cf1016ec20d7e7894481a247ee5d92401b29309c0d7c2d703", "ja": "（そういう桃子は、ちょっと気合いが\n入り過ぎて焦り気味かな？　でも……）", "zh": "（桃子自己则是因为太过投入，\n以至于有点焦虑吗？不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "36144fd652a3d39f70e8c4c0797e2764c46845c88acb23cf41d1a4e449a92564", "ja": "桃子、メッチャやる気やな～。\nいつもよりダメ出しが厳しいんちゃう？", "zh": "桃子，你好有干劲啊～\n今天纠正的标准比平常还要严格吼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1040_049mom", "source_sha256": "cea005f6eaa70c1285fa7805c09b2220a20e3d1b6ebb62790a63d3d19dfe3fc4", "ja": "それは、みんながだらしないからだよ。\n先輩の桃子が指導するのは、当然でしょ？", "zh": "那是因为大家太散漫了。\n桃子身为前辈，指导大家也是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1041_049mom", "source_sha256": "c4ae4d620ae703b8168d445ab5c4a14ceefc3868ad1820bf68ad849b23d2f138", "ja": "それに桃子、どうしても成功させたいんだもん。\nリコッタは、桃子達5人のユニットなんだから……。", "zh": "而且桃子无论如何都想让这个团体成功。\n因为『Ricotta』是桃子我们五个人的团体……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1042_043nor", "source_sha256": "e69dae10fba8950c0604c567eee0a56a89e22d94beae526a9068013723250706", "ja": "ふーん♪", "zh": "哦──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1043_037nao", "source_sha256": "0f354631ae3760a189651dbdfe151764320a25cd32eb298400ef3d54def9b97c", "ja": "ふふーん♪", "zh": "哦哦──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1044_049mom", "source_sha256": "3050d3f1a2f37a6e141f00224af476f0ac8d5db920cd7d5d3d54ad71200cf356", "ja": "な、何よ……！\nおかしい？", "zh": "什、什么啦……！\n有什么不对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1045_043nor", "source_sha256": "ea3958e88fdc87f221ad6c7e835b8eeae1e98beeeb59a013d24aa0cb23bc4346", "ja": "いやー？　桃子はアタシ達やリコッタのこと、\nすっごく大事に思ってくれてるんだなーって。", "zh": "没有啦～我只是在想，\n桃子真的很重视我们还有『Ricotta』呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1046_049mom", "source_sha256": "6e5b74a0b7c3378ed5329be8cc10d6813677f4e09d513d1b71ecad1b50bc45f3", "ja": "べっ……別に、そういうわけじゃないよ！\nただ、ちゃんとやってほしいだけ！", "zh": "才……才不是那样呢！\n桃子只是想让大家认真一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1047_037nao", "source_sha256": "06dab52aa959a9b8c7487219cb84e58d7c75a7e93835befe6b4193cd35e18779", "ja": "うんうん、せやな！\nホンマかわいいな～、桃子は！", "zh": "嗯嗯，嘿呀！\n你真的好可爱呀～桃子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1048_043nor", "source_sha256": "d58dcb48018287f726f89dbac79fe20a12e8bf4cc4b0013a04f0bb8e1f2d109e", "ja": "えへへ、こいつ～！\nなでてやるーっ。おりゃーっ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，你这小家伙～！\n给你摸摸头，喝呀──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1049_049mom", "source_sha256": "99f7846f74636a88176ec72c6d0706a8ee3ba8910b85b938e2f8396628b3bd0d", "ja": "や、やめてよ、のり子さん！\n桃子は先輩だって言ってるでしょ……！", "zh": "不、不要这样，法子姊！\n不是说了桃子是前辈吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1050_p", "source_sha256": "248014d2cf600d91d15249a814b8d40c0e8a7b7653d6ce34ae16ead7656eccad", "ja": "（桃子の焦りは、みんなにいい影響を与えている。\nこのまま受け止めてもらえるなら……）", "zh": "（桃子的焦虑给大家带来了好的影响。\n如果她可以就这样被大家接受……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1051_se", "source_sha256": "a393f153beba9193b68690ab68995c288177bc7f37c7bc43dd123a77901ceb5e", "ja": "カシャカシャカシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1052_028ari", "source_sha256": "0b5da40529aea5de2a6660838a718c829b3ef26f762866422ffe3e50c60bcd6c", "ja": "ふぉぉ～っ！　照れてる桃子ちゃんセンパイの\nベストショット、いただきましたよぉ～っ！", "zh": "唔喔～！\n拍到了小桃前辈害羞的超棒照片～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1053_049mom", "source_sha256": "d39458c9bd8500a03e130ea0b29e49bad918f137306c444ddfa88d9d581d9655", "ja": "あ、亜利沙さん、ふざけないで！\nあと、ヘンな呼び方しないで！", "zh": "亚、亚利沙姊，不要开玩笑了！\n然后，不要用奇怪的称呼叫桃子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1054_001har", "source_sha256": "d84bc22fcc94530b568fb27701bddffcd223214b8425ae15b402c5d29939100c", "ja": "ふふっ。……ねえねえ、桃子ちゃん。リコッタの\nレッスンの指導係、お願いしちゃってもいいかな？", "zh": "呵呵……问你喔，桃子。\n可以请你担任『Ricotta』训练课程的小老师吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1055_049mom", "source_sha256": "8f0314f2400518008dada62d20ef76620ef5c5a778e5fc9d46c0c709fa1378f6", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、そういうのは、リーダーの\n春香さんがやってくれるものじゃないの？", "zh": "咦！？这、这种事情，\n通常不是该由身为队长的春香姊来做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1056_001har", "source_sha256": "dd271f87b383463b125d0371f633a769c13fbc0b3322747097c9656a2ae5ad55", "ja": "私はお仕事の都合で、みんなとの練習に\n参加できない日もありそうなんだ。", "zh": "我因为工作的关系，\n有可能偶尔没办法跟大家一起参加练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1057_001har", "source_sha256": "474baf7999d83451a1bba78087d9ecc45d6eec89267be30539f049e377238075", "ja": "だから、桃子ちゃんに任せたいんだけど……\n{$P$}さん、いいと思いませんか？", "zh": "所以我想把这件事交给桃子……\n{$P$}先生，你不觉得很适合吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_1058", "source_sha256": "5f02c97716f4370dd341de184e572bca391c8aa731a0b28ff67821b369fdc8dc", "ja": "いいと思います", "zh": "我也觉得不错", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c0ed3676a74cbb43aff22b82517b82e6301982da109228533c3bc3aa1121b956", "ja": "いいと思うな。さっきの指摘も的確だったし。\nどうだ、桃子？", "zh": "我也觉得不错，刚刚的指导也很切中要点。\n桃子，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_2001_049mom", "source_sha256": "7a0b3378411b2d9c92488ba514e5f9fa8d2169de5355966bfa8572722ae074b5", "ja": "えっと。桃子は……。", "zh": "呃，桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_2002_043nor", "source_sha256": "44277c8d1be969f21767ff2576a2861ca396edfda8200a6123b006dcab18ddc5", "ja": "アタシも、いいと思うけどな～。", "zh": "我也觉得这样很好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_2003_037nao", "source_sha256": "83c10493d0398a9bbf381e88d6078ad8f41153e41e4c7a098ad61a871d2b78b5", "ja": "桃子のいうことやったら、\nなんや素直に聞けるしな！", "zh": "而且桃子说的话，\n很容易让人听进去呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_2004_028ari", "source_sha256": "8c1ae5f35e2152af4d03c36aeacca6b4b444d671fd2f87e55f018eb63c142ced", "ja": "ありさも、賛成ですっ！", "zh": "亚利沙也赞成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_2005_049mom", "source_sha256": "e09845ad2f6f970d0921a07381243dbad7db2dc5aa8daf7e35319fafc61eb424", "ja": "……うん！　みんなや春香さんがいいなら、やるよ。\nみんな！　遠慮しないで、桃子になんでも聞いてね！", "zh": "……嗯！既然大家跟春香姊都赞成，桃子就当吧。\n大家！不要客气，有任何问题都尽管问桃子吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_2006_001har", "source_sha256": "b20445789c9b429723867f72e83a4dd3b93fdf2125afede052bc596b6a23adc9", "ja": "ありがとう、桃子ちゃん！\nそれじゃ、改めてよろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "谢谢你，桃子！\n那就再次请你多多指教♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_2007_028ari", "source_sha256": "a335fa5cbf05d409d6ba82bd06123a7d0100f64979505568e8e643f1f70c9567", "ja": "はいはいはいっ！　ありさ、さっそく質問ですっ！", "zh": "这边这边这边！亚利沙这就有个问题想问！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_2008_049mom", "source_sha256": "85866eb5bc239c94d90e1c926c7abafd501641da9b038ec47fcc53690d369358", "ja": "なに？　亜利沙さん。", "zh": "亚利沙姊，什么问题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_2009_028ari", "source_sha256": "695d2a2e79fb54de7cd2400f691ac95a67e31e6446a3d89a2f231d62b451ab27", "ja": "桃子ちゃんセンパイの、\n休日の過ごし方を教えてくださいっ！", "zh": "请问小桃前辈在假日都做些什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_2010_049mom", "source_sha256": "cca3709d262f2534ebd7b1b3069b7e3dac608463ab5edcd97d5ecd8b6df2d403", "ja": "え？　休日の過ごし方って……えっと、\nこの前のオフは、育と環が一緒に遊ぼうって……。", "zh": "咦？假日都做些什么……这个嘛，\n上次休假的时候，育跟环说要一起出去玩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_02_2011_049mom", "source_sha256": "bd61dd2f8efc61b1e39e8e037e8b7a5b50bd7b4eee66a16b8cd19e9b8f663be4", "ja": "って、そうじゃないでしょ！？\nレッスンの質問なんだから、真面目にやって！", "zh": "呃，不是问这个吧！？\n桃子说的是跟训练课程有关的问题，认真一点啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
